  "description": "NaAuO₂ crystallizes in the monoclinic C2/m space group. Na¹⁺ is bonded to six equivalent O²⁻ atoms to form edge-sharing NaO₆ octahedra. There are two shorter (2.38 Å) and four longer (2.41 Å) Na-O bond lengths. Au³⁺ is bonded in a square co-planar geometry to four equivalent O²⁻ atoms. All Au-O bond lengths are 2.02 Å. O²⁻ is bonded to three equivalent Na¹⁺ and two equivalent Au³⁺ atoms to form a mixture of distorted corner and edge-sharing ONa₃Au₂ trigonal bipyramids.",
